{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ誕生日おめぺろ～(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/05/8980334/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"差し入れマカロン(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おとといは友達と映画を観てきたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『海月姫』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白かった～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメディタッチで\n中田の好きなタイプの映画でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/05/8980334/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"31日にも\n『アオハライド』観に行ってたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもそんなに頻繁に観ないから\n中田的 映画週間です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"STもドラマ観てたから観たいし\n寄生獣もストロボ・エッジも暗殺教室も観たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、おとといは映画観た後、\nいとこたちとご飯！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方から車でこっちに来てたみたいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/05/8980334/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、ドライブと言えば\n『乃木坂46navi』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうgetしてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46navi選抜に\n選んでいただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に選抜という言葉を聞きました(;_;)\n免許持ってて良かった(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46navi選抜メンバーそれぞれ\n録音してきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/05/8980334/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はいろいろ\n普通のナビとはだいぶ違うこと言ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/05/8980334/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でもナビの機能はしっかりしてるから\nちゃんと道案内はしてるよ`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい録音したので\nこのナビでいろんな所へ行ってみてほしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のイベントで遠征とかも是非！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/05/8980334/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お餅の入ったスイーツの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/05/8980334/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"saryo パフェ\nバニラアイス、いもけんぴ、わらびもち、きな粉パウンド、白玉、抹茶のミルクプリン、黒蜜ゼリーが入ってて\n満足感たっぷり＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あずきラテ\n粒が入ってて食感が楽しいし、\n程よい甘さ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和のスイーツはなにより落ち着く。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/05/8980334/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶鍋カフェ kagurazaka saryo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}